#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A table of the language features included in OpenQASM 3."
msgstr "Una tabla de las características del lenguaje incluidas en OpenQASM 3."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenQASM 3 feature table"
msgstr "Tabla de características de OpenQASM 3"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore negctrl, durationof, vstring */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore negctrl, durationof, vstring */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenQASM 3 feature table {#openqasm-3-feature-table}"
msgstr "Tabla de características de OpenQASM 3 {#openqasm-3-feature-table}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Below is a list of the `OpenQASM 3` language features.\n"
msgstr "A continuación se muestra una lista de las características del lenguaje `OpenQASM 3`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more details on these capabilities, see the [OpenQASM 3.X Live Specification](https://openqasm.com/).\n"
msgstr "Para más detalles sobre estas capacidades, consulta la [Especificación en vivo de OpenQASM 3.X](https://openqasm.com/).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key:\n"
msgstr "Clave:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "❌ Not supported\n"
msgstr "❌ No compatible\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "🟡 Partial support\n"
msgstr "🟡 Compatibilidad parcial\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "✅ Supported\n"
msgstr "✅ Compatible\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The meaning of the complete \"supported\" mark depends on the column:\n"
msgstr "El significado de la marca \"compatible\" completa depende de la columna:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Qiskit SDK*: The feature can be parsed by [`qiskit.qasm3.loads`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3) (by using the `qiskit-qasm3-import` extension), represented in a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit),\n"
"and exported to OpenQASM 3 by [`qiskit.qasm3.dumps`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3#dumps).\n"
msgstr ""
"*Qiskit SDK*: La característica puede ser analizada por [`qiskit.qasm3.loads`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3) (usando la extensión `qiskit-qasm3-import`), representada en un [`QuantumCircuit`,](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)\n"
"y exportada a OpenQASM 3 mediante [`qiskit.qasm3.dumps`.](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3#dumps)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "*IBM Quantum Compute Service*: A circuit containing the corresponding Qiskit feature can be successfully executed on hardware through IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
msgstr "*IBM Quantum Compute Service*: Un circuito que contiene la característica de Qiskit correspondiente puede ejecutarse correctamente en hardware a través de IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The meaning of \"partial support\" typically depends on the linked notes.\n"
msgstr "El significado de \"compatibilidad parcial\" depende generalmente de las notas enlazadas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
#| "The most common method of submitting circuits to IBM Qiskit Runtime is to create the circuit in the Python-space interface to Qiskit SDK.\n"
#| "Circuits constructed and submitted in this manner do not need to be loaded from OpenQASM 3 files into Qiskit SDK.\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The most common method of submitting circuits to IBM Quantum Compute Service is to create the circuit in the Python-space interface to Qiskit SDK.\n"
"Circuits constructed and submitted in this manner do not need to be loaded from OpenQASM 3 files into Qiskit SDK.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"El método más común para enviar circuitos a IBM Qiskit Runtime es crear el circuito en la interfaz Python de Qiskit SDK.\n"
"Los circuitos construidos y enviados de esta forma no necesitan cargarse desde archivos OpenQASM 3 a Qiskit SDK.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not use OpenQASM 3 directly yourself, you can safely use features that are supported for representation in Qiskit SDK, export to OpenQASM 3, and submission to IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
"This includes features that cannot be loaded by Qiskit SDK from OpenQASM 3.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Si no usas OpenQASM 3 directamente, puedes utilizar con seguridad las características que son compatibles para su representación en Qiskit SDK, exportación a OpenQASM 3 y envío a IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
"Esto incluye características que no pueden ser cargadas por Qiskit SDK desde OpenQASM 3.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

